        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st2",
        "text": "<i>The ravines, though eroded away by the past...</i>",
        "x": 220,
        "y": 200,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st3",
        "text": "<i>seem far more ancient than everything he's been through.</i>",
        "x": 220,
        "y": 280,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "stickerclear"
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "text": "<i>He cannot remember how long ago it was.</i>",
        "x": 780,
        "y": 320,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st2",
        "text": "<i>The campfire before him feels just as hot as it did then.</i>",
        "x": 780,
        "y": 400,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st3",
        "text": "<i>Time once burnt away rouses once again those muddled voices.</i>",
        "x": 780,
        "y": 480,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st4",
        "text": "<i>He cannot tell if it is he or the earth which is shaking...</i>",
        "x": 780,
        "y": 560,
