        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Akira.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, you're not dead yet, old timer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed, not yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unlike you, these fierce but dull-witted beasts will never defeat me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Life is stubborn, huh? That's what you think? Just like those beasts who keep crawling forward even with their skulls pierced?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_760_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not bad. You think that's what you've become.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen up. I will keep hunting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter if there are a hundred, a thousand, or even ten thousand of those beasts in the forest. I won't stop until they're all dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter what I am up against... One by one, I will kill each and every one of them with my own two hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to hunt the big one now. I have no time to deal with you or your word games.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
