    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_lightrain_loop",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "volume": 1,
        "fadetime": 6,
        "crosstime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough*\u2014Scratch marks, and huge ones, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "It must've been here not too long ago... It's hungry, and it's on the hunt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't stand a chance tonight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Preposterous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_760_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're old and battered, and you've just been through a brutal struggle. Plus, it's raining, and there's no one to help you here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you keep going like this, you <i>will</i> die. You're no wild beast. You know that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not like you... I won't go down so easily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_760_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know who you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Look at these fallen leaves. If I cover these marks with them, no one will know they weren't washed here by the rain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "No one else will find its tracks. This hunt is mine and mine alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_760_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really, old timer, sometimes I don't get what the point of all this is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "So now you're going to criticize me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I did was take your place and do what you would.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_760_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chasing beasts into the forest like it's the end of the world... hacking and slashing at them, carving out their hearts, and coming home covered in cuts and bruises...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "You used to blabber about hunting day in and day out. Isn't that what you loved the most?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_760_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even after all this time, you still don't understand me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? I don't understand you? Then what about you? Do you think you all your actions were correct?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've never once listened to what I say. Have you ever tried to understand how <i>I</i> feel? Even once?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "That night, if you had listened to even a single word I said...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you hadn't charged into this damnable forest, you wouldn't have turned into an unrecognizable pile of minced meat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I would never have left you behind like those guys did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you still not understand? Everything that I do... I'm doing it for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_760_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Yoshitaka, you're doing it for yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you know it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "He can't hear your voice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
