    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We meet again, Kashiwau.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So that was you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I warned you not to enter the forest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're free to come and go as we please. We have no reason to be intimidated by you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You stubborn kids don't know what's good for you... You don't know what real fear is!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will <i>die</i>! Do you get it? Die!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe. But more importantly, nothing can scare us off from completing our mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And may I ask you to set down what you're holding?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is <i>my</i> hunting equipment... Mine, you thieves!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Feel free to take what's yours, but please put down the things that belong to us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't need them, and that's because you're leaving this forest right this instant! Don't even think about getting in my way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#12$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Preposterous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I see now... You're just here to make trouble for me, aren't you? You want to take everything from me, don't you? Just like them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#12$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're overthinking this. I'm only worried about your safety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You see, Kashiwau, you came here too. Which means we share the same objective.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#12$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't understand why you feel the way you do, and naturally I don't need to know either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I have a suggestion. Let's set aside our differences and work together. We can solve a lot of problems that way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#12$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not a chance! That quarry is mine and nobody else's!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, I ask only that you not interfere with our work anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Furthermore, considering we have the same objective, your actions will likely affect us one way or another...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So I suggest you wait at the camp until daybreak. You're free to return to the village after that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yato, that's a bit...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You... How dare you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Begone! Crawl back to wherever you came from!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I refuse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on, you two.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I'll have the lot of you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekohappy01"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Smithy, what do you see?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hunters! You need to leave this place and put out that campfire immediately!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That voice... You're...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The firelight has attracted the Rathalos's attention. It'll come attacking any second now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Rathalos?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Rathalos!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
